<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MOOL — Start at the root · Scalp-first botanical hair care</title>
<meta name="description" content="Scalp-first hair rituals built on two botanicals — rosemary for the scalp, bhringraj for strength. A routine, not a shelf of oils.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;1,9..144,300;1,9..144,400&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --field:#10201A;
    --panel:#172E23;
    --panel-2:#1E3B2C;
    --line:rgba(241,236,223,.14);
    --line-soft:rgba(241,236,223,.08);
    --bone:#F1ECDF;
    --bone-dim:rgba(241,236,223,.62);
    --bone-faint:rgba(241,236,223,.40);
    --sage:#9DB79A;
    --brass:#C6A566;
    --brass-deep:#a8894f;
    --ink:#12211A;
    --serif:"Fraunces",Georgia,serif;
    --sans:"Inter",system-ui,sans-serif;
    --mono:"IBM Plex Mono",monospace;
    --nav-h:66px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{
    background:var(--field);color:var(--bone);font-family:var(--sans);
    line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  body.locked{overflow:hidden}
  .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px}
  .mono{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass)}
  .serif{font-family:var(--serif)}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none;color:inherit}
  img,svg{display:block}
  .rule{height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:0}

  /* buttons */
  .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em;
    padding:13px 22px;border-radius:3px;transition:background .25s,color .25s,border-color .25s,transform .1s}
  .btn:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  .btn-brass{background:var(--brass);color:var(--ink)}
  .btn-brass:hover{background:#d4b578}
  .btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--bone);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--brass);color:var(--brass)}

  /* reveal */
  .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
  .rv.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.rv{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}html{scroll-behavior:auto}}

  /* ---------------- NAV ---------------- */
  nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:60;height:var(--nav-h);
    display:flex;align-items:center;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,backdrop-filter .35s;
    border-bottom:1px solid transparent}
  nav.scrolled{background:rgba(16,32,26,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom-color:var(--line)}
  .nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%}
  .nav-mark{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:23px;letter-spacing:.06em;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.28em}
  .nav-mark .deva{font-size:.5em;color:var(--brass);font-weight:300;transform:translateY(-.15em)}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center}
  .nav-links a{font-size:13px;color:var(--bone-dim);letter-spacing:.02em;transition:color .2s;position:relative}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--bone)}
  .nav-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}
  .bag-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--bone);padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:3px;transition:border-color .2s}
  .bag-btn:hover{border-color:var(--brass)}
  .bag-count{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;min-width:18px;height:18px;padding:0 5px;border-radius:9px;
    background:var(--brass);color:var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:500;
    transition:transform .25s}
  .bag-count.bump{transform:scale(1.35)}
  .menu-toggle{display:none}

  /* ---------------- HERO ---------------- */
  header.hero{position:relative;padding:calc(var(--nav-h) + 78px) 0 84px;overflow:hidden}
  .hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:720px}
  .eyebrow{margin-bottom:30px}
  .wordmark{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.02em;
    font-size:clamp(92px,21vw,236px);line-height:.84;color:var(--bone);display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.1em}
  .wordmark .deva{font-size:.2em;color:var(--brass);letter-spacing:0;transform:translateY(-.75em);font-weight:300}
  .tag{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(24px,3.8vw,38px);color:var(--sage);margin-top:16px}
  .lede{max-width:540px;margin-top:24px;font-size:17px;color:var(--bone-dim)}
  .hero-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:36px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .sprig{position:absolute;top:calc(var(--nav-h) - 20px);right:-40px;width:min(48vw,560px);opacity:.55;z-index:1;pointer-events:none}
  .hero-meta{display:flex;gap:34px;margin-top:52px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .hero-meta .m .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bone-faint);margin-bottom:6px}
  .hero-meta .m .v{font-size:14px;color:var(--bone-dim)}
  .hero-meta .m .v b{color:var(--bone);font-weight:600}

  /* ---------------- SECTIONS ---------------- */
  section{padding:80px 0}
  .sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:40px}
  .sec-head .num{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--brass)}
  .sec-head h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(27px,4vw,42px);letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .sec-head .aside{margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--bone-faint);max-width:280px;text-align:right}

  .thesis{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(27px,4.6vw,48px);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:-.015em;max-width:940px}
  .thesis em{font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)}

  /* ---------------- INGREDIENTS ---------------- */
  .botanicals{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
  .bot{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:34px 30px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .bot .leaf{position:absolute;top:-24px;right:-24px;width:150px;opacity:.16;pointer-events:none}
  .bot .role{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:16px}
  .bot h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:30px;margin-bottom:6px}
  .bot .latin{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:300;font-size:15px;color:var(--bone-faint);margin-bottom:18px}
  .bot p{font-size:15px;color:var(--bone-dim);position:relative;z-index:2}
  .bot .used{margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--bone-faint)}
  .bot .used b{color:var(--brass);font-weight:500}

  /* ---------------- PRODUCTS ---------------- */
  .prod-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:16px}
  .prod{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:28px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}
  .prod:hover{background:var(--panel-2);border-color:rgba(198,165,106,.4)}
  .prod .role-tag{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;
    padding:4px 9px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--sage);border-radius:2px;margin-bottom:20px;align-self:flex-start}
  .prod.hero-prod .role-tag{background:var(--brass);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--brass);font-weight:500}
  .prod h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:5px}
  .prod .fn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:16px}
  .prod .claim{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--bone-dim);margin-bottom:22px;flex:1}
  .prod .spec{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:20px}
  .prod .spec span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--bone-faint);
    border:1px solid var(--line-soft);border-radius:2px;padding:5px 9px}
  .prod .spec span b{color:var(--bone-dim);font-weight:500}
  .prod .buy{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .prod .price{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;color:var(--brass)}
  .prod .price small{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11px;color:var(--bone-faint);letter-spacing:.02em;margin-right:3px}
  .add-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.03em;
    padding:11px 18px;border:1px solid var(--brass);color:var(--brass);border-radius:3px;transition:background .25s,color .25s}
  .add-btn:hover{background:var(--brass);color:var(--ink)}
  .add-btn.added{background:var(--sage);border-color:var(--sage);color:var(--ink)}

  /* ---------------- RITUAL ---------------- */
  .ritual{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden}
  .step{background:var(--field);padding:30px 24px}
  .step .n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:44px;font-weight:300;color:var(--brass);line-height:1;margin-bottom:16px}
  .step .when{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:10px}
  .step h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:19px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:10px}
  .step p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--bone-dim)}

  /* ---------------- CLAIMS ---------------- */
  .claims{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden}
  .claims .col{background:var(--panel);padding:32px 28px}
  .claims .col.dont{background:#1a2620}
  .claims .col h3{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}
  .claims .say h3{color:var(--brass)}
  .claims .dont h3{color:#c69b96}
  .claims li{list-style:none;padding:11px 0;font-size:14.5px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line)}
  .claims li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .claims .mk{flex:0 0 auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}
  .say .mk{color:var(--brass)}
  .dont .mk{color:#c07d78}
  .claims .dont li{color:var(--bone-dim);text-decoration:line-through;text-decoration-color:rgba(192,125,120,.45)}
  .claim-note{margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--bone-faint);max-width:820px}
  .claim-note em{color:var(--sage);font-style:normal}

  /* ---------------- BUNDLES ---------------- */
  .bundles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}
  .bundle{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;padding:32px 28px;background:var(--panel);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .bundle.feature{border-color:var(--brass);background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--panel-2),var(--panel))}
  .bundle .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:16px}
  .bundle h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:28px;margin-bottom:12px}
  .bundle .contains{font-size:14px;color:var(--bone-dim);margin-bottom:24px;flex:1}
  .bundle .foot{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
  .bundle .pr{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:32px;color:var(--brass)}
  .bundle .pr small{display:block;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:11.5px;color:var(--bone-faint);letter-spacing:.02em;margin-top:4px}

  /* ---------------- NEWSLETTER ---------------- */
  .signup{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:52px 44px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .signup h2{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(26px,3.6vw,38px);margin-bottom:12px}
  .signup p{font-size:15px;color:var(--bone-dim);max-width:440px;margin:0 auto 28px}
  .signup form{display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .signup input{flex:1;min-width:220px;background:var(--field);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:3px;
    padding:13px 16px;color:var(--bone);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px}
  .signup input::placeholder{color:var(--bone-faint)}
  .signup input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--brass)}
  .signup .ok{margin-top:18px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--sage);letter-spacing:.04em;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}
  .signup .ok.show{opacity:1}

  /* ---------------- FOOTER ---------------- */
  footer{padding:62px 0 60px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:32px;margin-bottom:44px}
  .fmark{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.05em;margin-bottom:14px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.3em}
  .fmark .deva{color:var(--brass);font-size:.5em;font-weight:300;transform:translateY(-.15em)}
  .foot-tag{font-family:var(--serif);font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:var(--sage);font-size:16px}
  .foot-col h5{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bone-faint);margin-bottom:16px}
  .foot-col a{display:block;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--bone-dim);padding:5px 0;transition:color .2s}
  .foot-col a:hover{color:var(--bone)}
  .disc{font-size:12px;color:var(--bone-faint);max-width:820px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .disc b{color:var(--sage);font-weight:500}

  /* ---------------- CART DRAWER ---------------- */
  .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(10,20,16,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .35s,visibility .35s;z-index:90}
  .overlay.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible}
  .drawer{position:fixed;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;width:min(420px,92vw);background:var(--field);border-left:1px solid var(--line);
    z-index:100;transform:translateX(100%);transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .drawer.open{transform:none}
  .drawer-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:24px 26px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .drawer-head h3{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:22px}
  .drawer-head .close{font-size:22px;color:var(--bone-dim);width:34px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;transition:color .2s,background .2s}
  .drawer-head .close:hover{color:var(--bone);background:var(--panel)}
  .drawer-body{flex:1;overflow-y:auto;padding:8px 26px}
  .cart-empty{padding:60px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--bone-faint)}
  .cart-empty .em-mark{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:40px;color:var(--line);margin-bottom:14px}
  .cart-empty p{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:22px}
  .ci{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft)}
  .ci .swatch{flex:0 0 52px;height:64px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--panel);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .ci .swatch svg{width:26px;opacity:.7}
  .ci .info{flex:1;min-width:0}
  .ci .info h4{font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:3px}
  .ci .info .sz{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--bone-faint);text-transform:uppercase}
  .ci .qty{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;margin-top:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:3px;width:fit-content}
  .ci .qty button{width:28px;height:28px;color:var(--bone-dim);font-size:15px;transition:color .2s}
  .ci .qty button:hover{color:var(--brass)}
  .ci .qty span{width:32px;text-align:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px}
  .ci .right{text-align:right;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end}
  .ci .right .p{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:var(--bone)}
  .ci .right .rm{font-size:11px;color:var(--bone-faint);letter-spacing:.03em;transition:color .2s}
  .ci .right .rm:hover{color:#c07d78}
  .drawer-foot{padding:22px 26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .sub-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:6px}
  .sub-row .lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--bone-dim)}
  .sub-row .val{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:26px;color:var(--brass)}
  .ship-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--bone-faint);margin-bottom:18px}
  .checkout{width:100%;justify-content:center;background:var(--brass);color:var(--ink);padding:15px;border-radius:3px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:background .25s}
  .checkout:hover{background:#d4b578}

  /* toast */
  .toast{position:fixed;bottom:26px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);z-index:120;
    background:var(--panel-2);border:1px solid var(--brass);border-radius:4px;padding:13px 22px;
    font-size:13px;color:var(--bone);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .3s,transform .3s,visibility .3s;
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
  .toast.show{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
  .toast .dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sage)}

  /* ---------------- RESPONSIVE ---------------- */
  @media(max-width:860px){
    .nav-links{display:none}
    .menu-toggle{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;padding:8px;width:38px}
    .menu-toggle span{height:1.5px;width:20px;background:var(--bone);transition:transform .3s,opacity .3s}
    .menu-toggle.on span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6.5px) rotate(45deg)}
    .menu-toggle.on span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
    .menu-toggle.on span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6.5px) rotate(-45deg)}
    .mobile-menu{position:fixed;top:var(--nav-h);left:0;right:0;background:rgba(16,32,26,.97);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);z-index:55;transform:translateY(-12px);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;
      transition:opacity .3s,transform .3s,visibility .3s;padding:14px 28px 26px}
    .mobile-menu.open{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}
    .mobile-menu a{display:block;font-size:16px;color:var(--bone-dim);padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-soft);font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:300}
    .botanicals,.prod-grid,.claims,.bundles{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .ritual{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
    .sec-head .aside{display:none}
    .sprig{opacity:.22}
    .signup{padding:40px 24px}
  }
  @media(max-width:520px){
    .ritual{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    section{padding:60px 0}
  }
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brass);outline-offset:3px}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
<nav id="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a href="#top" class="nav-mark">MOOL<span class="deva">मूल</span></a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#routine">The Routine</a>
      <a href="#ingredients">Ingredients</a>
      <a href="#ritual">The Ritual</a>
      <a href="#honesty">Our Claims</a>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-right">
      <button class="bag-btn" onclick="openCart()" aria-label="Open bag">
        Bag <span class="bag-count" id="bagCount">0</span>
      </button>
      <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Menu">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <a href="#routine">The Routine</a>
  <a href="#ingredients">Ingredients</a>
  <a href="#ritual">The Ritual</a>
  <a href="#honesty">Our Claims</a>
</div>

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<header class="hero" id="top">
  <svg class="sprig" viewBox="0 0 300 400" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M150 400 C150 300 150 200 150 40" stroke="#9DB79A" stroke-width="2" stroke-opacity="0.5"/>
    <g stroke="#9DB79A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-opacity="0.55" stroke-linecap="round">
      <path d="M150 70 C120 60 96 66 74 44 M150 70 C180 60 204 66 226 44"/>
      <path d="M150 110 C118 100 92 106 68 82 M150 110 C182 100 208 106 232 82"/>
      <path d="M150 152 C120 142 96 148 74 126 M150 152 C180 142 204 148 226 126"/>
      <path d="M150 196 C116 186 90 192 66 168 M150 196 C184 186 210 192 234 168"/>
      <path d="M150 240 C120 230 96 236 76 214 M150 240 C180 230 204 236 224 214"/>
      <path d="M150 286 C122 276 98 282 80 262 M150 286 C178 276 202 282 220 262"/>
      <path d="M150 40 C138 26 140 14 150 2 C160 14 162 26 150 40Z" fill="#9DB79A" fill-opacity="0.18"/>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow mono">Scalp-first botanical hair care</div>
    <div class="wordmark">MOOL<span class="deva">मूल</span></div>
    <div class="tag">Start at the root.</div>
    <p class="lede">Scalp-first hair rituals built on two botanicals — rosemary for the scalp, bhringraj for strength. A routine, not a shelf of oils.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#routine" class="btn btn-brass">Shop the routine →</a>
      <a href="#ritual" class="btn btn-ghost">How the ritual works</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <div class="m"><div class="k">Built on</div><div class="v"><b>Two botanicals</b>, not twenty</div></div>
      <div class="m"><div class="k">Starts at</div><div class="v">The <b>scalp</b>, where hair is made</div></div>
      <div class="m"><div class="k">The promise</div><div class="v"><b>Honest claims</b>, exact directions</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="rule"></div>

<!-- ===== THESIS ===== -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="thesis rv">Most hair brands sell you more bottles. <em>We sell you one routine —</em> and we start at the scalp, because that's where hair is actually made or broken.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="rule"></div>

<!-- ===== INGREDIENTS ===== -->
<section id="ingredients">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="num">01</span>
      <h2 class="serif">Two botanicals, two jobs</h2>
      <p class="aside">We name the actives and give the dose. Nothing hides behind a "proprietary blend."</p>
    </div>
    <div class="botanicals">
      <div class="bot rv">
        <svg class="leaf" viewBox="0 0 100 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M50 120 L50 20" stroke="#9DB79A" stroke-width="2"/>
          <g stroke="#9DB79A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M50 40 C36 34 26 38 16 26 M50 40 C64 34 74 38 84 26"/>
            <path d="M50 62 C34 56 24 60 14 48 M50 62 C66 56 76 60 86 48"/>
            <path d="M50 84 C36 78 26 82 18 70 M50 84 C64 78 74 82 82 70"/>
            <path d="M50 104 C38 98 30 102 22 92 M50 104 C62 98 70 102 78 92"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <div class="role">For the scalp</div>
        <h3>Rosemary</h3>
        <div class="latin">Rosmarinus officinalis</div>
        <p>The scalp is the soil. Rosemary refreshes and clarifies it — clearing the day's buildup so roots have a clean, awake place to grow from. It's the reset the rest of the routine is built on.</p>
        <div class="used">In · <b>Scalp Tonic</b> + <b>Strength Shampoo</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bot rv">
        <svg class="leaf" viewBox="0 0 100 120" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M50 120 C50 90 50 60 50 24" stroke="#9DB79A" stroke-width="2"/>
          <g stroke="#9DB79A" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M50 34 C40 20 44 12 50 6 C56 12 60 20 50 34"/>
            <path d="M50 58 C38 50 30 54 20 42 M50 58 C62 50 70 54 80 42"/>
            <path d="M50 82 C40 74 32 78 24 68 M50 82 C60 74 68 78 76 68"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
        <div class="role">For strength</div>
        <h3>Bhringraj</h3>
        <div class="latin">Eclipta alba</div>
        <p>The classic strength botanical. Bhringraj conditions dry roots and lengths and helps hair feel less prone to breakage — so what grows in has a better chance of staying put.</p>
        <div class="used">In · <b>Root Strength Oil</b> + <b>Neelibhringadi Oil</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="rule"></div>

