<!-- ===== RITUAL ===== -->
<section id="ritual">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="num">03</span>
      <h2 class="serif">A week with MOOL</h2>
      <p class="aside">A rhythm you can actually keep — not a shelf you feel guilty about.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ritual rv">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">01</div>
        <div class="when">Every night</div>
        <h4>Scalp Tonic</h4>
        <p>A few drops of the leave-in tonic, worked into the scalp. The daily reset — lightweight, no oily weight.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">02</div>
        <div class="when">2–3× a week</div>
        <h4>Pre-wash oil</h4>
        <p>Massage Bhringraj Root Strength Oil through before you wash. Leave 30 minutes, then cleanse.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">03</div>
        <div class="when">1–2× a week</div>
        <h4>Deep condition</h4>
        <p>Swap in the Neelibhringadi Intensive when hair feels dry, rough or overworked.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="n">04</div>
        <div class="when">As needed</div>
        <h4>Cleanse</h4>
        <p>The Rosemary Strength Shampoo clears buildup without stripping — then start again at the root.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="rule"></div>

<!-- ===== HONESTY ===== -->
<section id="honesty">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="num">04</span>
      <h2 class="serif">What we say — and what we never say</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="claims rv">
      <div class="col say">
        <h3><span>✓</span> We say</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="mk">✓</span> Stronger, fuller-looking hair</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✓</span> Helps reduce breakage</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✓</span> Refreshes &amp; clarifies the scalp</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✓</span> Conditions dry hair; adds softness &amp; shine</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✓</span> Clears buildup without stripping</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col dont">
        <h3><span>✕</span> We never say</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="mk">✕</span> Regrows hair / cures baldness</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✕</span> Stops hair fall / treats hair loss</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✕</span> Reverses greying</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✕</span> Treats dandruff / scalp disease</li>
          <li><span class="mk">✕</span> Clinically proven — without a study on file</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="claim-note">The right-hand column isn't just caution — <em>it's the brand.</em> Honesty about a scalp routine, instead of false growth promises, is how we earn trust and how we stay on the right side of the Drugs &amp; Magic Remedies Act. A claim only moves to the left when there's a formula and evidence behind it.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="rule"></div>

