        <p class="contains">All four: Scalp Tonic, Bhringraj Oil, Neelibhringadi Oil &amp; Rosemary Shampoo. The full scalp-to-lengths routine — delivered on refill, cancel anytime.</p>
        <div class="foot">
          <div class="pr">₹1,299<small>Best price · subscription</small></div>
          <button class="add-btn" data-bundle="ritual">Add to bag</button>
        </div>
      </div>
